// Ch4 C4-04 "Cutscene: the shell is set" and C4-05 "Leaving the feast" (docs/kb/story/beats/act1_ch04.md).
// The chapter's longest scene; words are spent here on purpose. Letterboxed.
// H08 (night): the wall, the clean gap at shoulder height that Ch2 showed (the Pila scene, N-03), and
// beside it, washed tonight, Imra's shell. Osu holds Asha's shell, new-cut, the whitest on the wall.
// The setting: Osu sets it with her thumbs, the way you'd close someone's eyes. The Reed recites one
// line of the Canticle (recited, never sung: bible §4). Osu says the four Velamir names on the wall,
// the oldest first, then Asha's, in the same voice.
// The speaking: each household says one thing it will keep of her. Neme can't; Asha says it for her,
// smiling (she finishes other people's comfort for them). Neme laughs, and it breaks.
// The song: "The Long Way Round", the Low Reaches farewell for a voyage, the one you sing so a sailor
// comes back the long way, safe. Unaccompanied, a hundred voices (diegetic; Audio writes an original
// tune, the_long_way_round). They sing it for her, and everyone singing knows she isn't coming back.
// The lyric is Narrative's, written here; the #sung lines are the village's, as captions.
// Rhen understands (H16, 85 mm, held): the voice guide's line, low, to Toma. The B08 payoff when
// ch03_rhen_asked_after. H14: Asha has heard him. She keeps singing. Her face doesn't change.
// C4-05 (H12, one take): Rhen puts down his plate and walks out of the lamplight, not storming, fast,
// the way he does everything when he's scared. Asha, still in the last verse, touches Toma's arm.
// The chapter flow sets ch04_shell_set (the wall shows Asha's shell from here on: Ch18, the Ending).
// Watch (ADR 0022): nothing here links the lullaby, the lantern or the comb to Dace.
title: ch04_shell_is_set
location: ch04/haluna_wake
---
@letterbox on
@camera H08
@music haluna_wake fade=2.0
@mark osu wall_gap walk
@wait 1.0
Osu [neutral]: Bring your lights close. It's time. #line:ch04_shell_001
@anim osu set_shell
@sfx shell_set at=wall_gap
@wait 2.0
Reed [neutral]: The water keeps what it is given, and gives back what it keeps. #line:ch04_shell_002 #tn:"One line of the Canticle of Level Water, recited, never sung."
@wait 1.0
Osu [neutral]: Mara Velamir. Ilse Velamir. Teodra Velamir. Imra Velamir. #line:ch04_shell_003
@wait 0.8
Osu [neutral]: Asha Velamir. #line:ch04_shell_004
@wait 1.5
@camera H12
Osu [neutral]: Now. Each house, the one thing it keeps. #line:ch04_shell_005
Vendor [soft_smile]: Her knots. #line:ch04_shell_006
Fisher [neutral]: The way she laughs at the wrong part of a story. #line:ch04_shell_007
Netmender [tender]: She sang my mother out. I keep that. #line:ch04_shell_008
Child [neutral]: She let me hold the shrine bell once. #line:ch04_shell_009
@wait 1.0
@camera H08
@face neme grief 0.5
@wait 1.5
@wait 1.5
Asha [smile]: She's going to keep my bad stool. The one that bites. Aren't you. #line:ch04_shell_010
@anim neme laugh_breaks
Neme [laugh]: That stool. That terrible stool. #line:ch04_shell_011
@face neme grief 0.8
@wait 1.5
@music the_long_way_round fade=2.0
@camera H12 blend=3.0
Bring her round by the long way, by the reef and the weed and the light. #line:ch04_shell_012 #sung #tn:"'The Long Way Round': a Low Reaches farewell song for a voyage, sung by the whole village. Plain words; keep it singable."
Bring her round by the long way, and the tide will bring her home by night. #line:ch04_shell_013 #sung
Don't go the short way over, where the deep is cold and wide. #line:ch04_shell_014 #sung
Come round the long way, love, come round the long way, on the tide. #line:ch04_shell_015 #sung
@camera H16
@wait 2.0
Rhen [neutral]: Everyone keeps saying she's going on a pilgrimage. #line:ch04_shell_016
Rhen [angry]: Nobody says she's coming back from one. #line:ch04_shell_017
<<if $ch03_rhen_asked_after>>
Toma [sad]: You asked me. On the steps. #line:ch04_shell_018
Rhen [angry]: And you said ask her. I'm asking the whole village. #line:ch04_shell_019
<<else>>
@wait 1.5
Toma [sad]: No. They do not. #line:ch04_shell_020
<<endif>>
@camera H17
@face asha soft_smile 0.0
@wait 2.5
Come round the long way, love, come round the long way, on the tide. #line:ch04_shell_021 #sung
@camera H12
@anim rhen put_down_plate
@mark rhen leave_rhen walk
@wait 1.0
@anim toma follow
@anim asha touch_arm toma
Asha [tender]: Let me. #line:ch04_shell_022
Toma [worried]: It is your wake. #line:ch04_shell_023
Asha [soft_smile]: Then I can leave it if I like. #line:ch04_shell_024
@mark asha leave_asha walk
@wait 1.5
@mark toma leave_toma walk
@wait 3.0
@fade out 1.0
@letterbox off
===
